{"id":683,"education_philosophy":null,"history":null,"facilities":null,"feature_summary":"情操教育と進学指導を柱にする女子教育","feature_description":"大阪の大谷中学校は、宗教教育を中心とする情操教育、進学指導、生徒指導を教育の柱としています。人を思いやる心を育てるとともに、ICTを活用しながら、授業で考えを交わして理解を深める学びを重視します。中学募集では医進、特進、凛花グローバル探究の三つのコースを設けています。医療系や理科系の学びに特色があり、希望する進路に向けて学ぶ環境を整えています。","clubs":[],"profile_sources":[{"id":3811,"attribute_key":"feature_summary","source_url":"https://www.osk-ohtani.ed.jp/education/","source_kind":"official_site","external_school_code":null,"verified_at":"2026-11-20","source_excerpt":null,"fetched_at":null,"content_hash":null,"invalidated_at":null,"priority":null},{"id":3812,"attribute_key":"feature_description","source_url":"https://www.osk-ohtani.ed.jp/education/","source_kind":"official_site","external_school_code":null,"verified_at":"2026-11-20","source_excerpt":null,"fetched_at":null,"content_hash":null,"invalidated_at":null,"priority":null}]}
